features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: EH55-H3K8","c":[]},{"h":"Battery Capacity: 8*12V/7Ah","c":[]},{"h":"Battery Type: Lead Acid Battery","c":[]},{"h":"Input Voltage: 208/220/230/240VAC","c":[]},{"h":"Rated Capacity: 3KVA/3KW","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Specification","active":true,"cls":"tab-1","noExpand":false,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Description","active":false,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h3>The Must EH55-H3K8 3KVA <a href=\"/ups-and-ips/online-ups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Online UPS</a> is a high-performance, double-conversion pure sine wave UPS engineered to deliver stable and uninterrupted power to mission-critical systems. Designed with true online technology, this UPS ensures zero transfer time, making it ideal for sensitive equipment such as servers, data center hardware, high-end workstations, telecom systems, and enterprise IT infrastructure.</h3><p><br></p><p>With its wide input voltage range (110V–300V) and advanced DSP control, the Must EH55-H3K8 provides consistent power output even in highly unstable power conditions. Its efficient power conversion and intelligent battery management guarantee longer battery life and smooth backup performance during outages.</p><p><br></p><p>This 3KVA UPS features a durable structure, powerful internal circuitry, and a user-friendly LCD display that shows real-time voltage, battery level, load status, and system alerts. Built for professional environments, the Must EH55-H3K8 is an excellent choice for businesses that require reliable and clean power protection.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>3KVA / 3KW True Online Double-Conversion UPS</li><li>Pure Sine Wave Output for critical applications</li><li>Zero Transfer Time for uninterrupted operation</li><li>Wide Input Voltage Range: 110V – 300V</li><li>Advanced DSP technology for stable performance</li><li>Supports external high-capacity battery banks</li><li>Ideal for servers, switches, routers, PBX, NAS &amp; medical equipment</li><li>LCD Display for easy monitoring and diagnostics</li><li>Strong protections: overload, surge, overheating &amp; short circuit</li><li>Designed for enterprise, telecom &amp; IT infrastructure environments</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"KSTAR HP SERIES 3KVA ONLINE UPS (WITH 8PCS BATTERY, STANDARD BACKUP, FOR PC AND NETWORKING DEVICE ONLY)","href":"/kstar-hp-series-3kva-online-ups-with-8pcs-battery-standard-backup-for-pc-and-networking-device-only","now":"38,000৳","old":"39,100৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3KRS 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3krs-3kva-online-ups","now":"40,000৳","old":"42,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H1K3 1KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h1k3-1kva-online-ups","now":"21,500৳","old":"24,000৳","single":""},{"name":"APC Smart 1000VA online UPS","href":"/apc-smart-1000va-online-ups","now":"23,000৳","old":"25,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H1KS 1KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h1ks-1kva-online-ups","now":"29,000৳","old":"31,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3KR 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3kr-3kva-online-ups","now":"44,000৳","old":"4,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsriva MR-US6K Energy Efficient 6kVA Online UPS","href":"/marsriva-mr-us6k-energy-efficient-6kva-online-ups","now":"105,000৳","old":"108,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3K6 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3k6-3kva-online-ups","now":"38,000৳","old":"40,000৳","single":""},{"name":"MARSRIVA MR-US3K - Energy Efficient 3KVA ONLINE UPS","href":"/marsriva-mr-us3k-energy-efficient-3kva-online-ups","now":"","old":"","single":"48,000৳"},{"name":"Marsiva MR-US1K Energy Efficient 1kVA Online UPS","href":"/marsiva-mr-us1k-energy-efficient-1kva-online-ups","now":"","old":"","single":"24,500৳"}]},{"title":"Video","ac